// --- Formal long percussion ensemble march ---------------------------------
// These routes make form:formal_long_march work for type:percussion_ensemble.
// The four percussion roles are aligned to the same section plan, but each role
// uses a different density: timpani pedal, snare-like accents, bass-drum pulses,
// and cymbal/cadence accents.

@withoutSpaces
MUSICAL_FORM → FORMAL_LONG_PERCUSSION_PEDAL_MARCH
